      "title": "DVB-S2-BB: Fix CNI field encoding in Mode Adaptation Header",
      "message": "DVB-S2-BB: Fix CNI field encoding in Mode Adaptation Header\n\nThe CNI (Carrier to Noise plus Interference) field in the DVB-S2 Mode\nAdaptation Header was previously decoded according to SatLabs documentation.\nHowever, the official ETSI EN 302 307-1 standard specifies a different\nencoding for this field.\n\nThis commit updates the CNI decoding logic to align with the normative\nETSI EN 302 307-1 standard instead of the SatLabs research document.\n\nFixes: #21385\n\nAI-Assisted: No\n",
      "author_name": "Andrey Miadelets",
      "author_email": "andreymydelec@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2026-07-07T11:42:28.000+07:00",
